      "created_at": "2018-11-06T14:04:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Voss’s deck isn’t much of a reflection of facing him directly it’s about his invasion. &nbsp;Considering what we were told during his episode when it was him directly fighting at times&nbsp;I’m not all that surprised he could hit OblivAeon that hard. &nbsp; Add on as bigbywolfe said about no shield on OblivAeon&nbsp;and being suckered punch by a guy with little to lose at that point it makes sense he could cause more damage then. &nbsp;</p>",
