      "id": 223793,
      "name": "FrivYeti",
      "username": "FrivYeti",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-11-06T23:00:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hang on.</p>\n<p>C&amp;A said that Setback created the Miststorm universe, but that's not right!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Setback got involved and meddled with Chrono-Ranger's badge, thereby reversing time and creating a new timeline in which Chrono-Ranger didn't die and part of Rook City survived. That timeline isn't the Miststorm timeline. The Miststorm timeline is the one in which CR stayed dead, and Rook City was fully broken. The timeline that Setback created was the much more hopeful RPG timeline.</p>\n<p>Am I missing something there?</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:57:01.647Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 18679,
      "topic_slug": "editor-s-note-23-oblivaeon-followup",
      "display_username": "FrivYeti",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Hang on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>C&amp;A said that Setback created the Miststorm universe, but that's not right!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Setback got involved and meddled with Chrono-Ranger's badge, thereby reversing time and creating a new timeline in which Chrono-Ranger didn't die and part of Rook City survived. That timeline isn't the Miststorm timeline. The Miststorm timeline is the one in which CR stayed dead, and Rook City was fully broken. The timeline that Setback created was the much more hopeful RPG timeline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Am I missing something there?</p>",
